  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Misengini mamoko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ne Musa niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Wuo gi jo-Israel kendo iwachnegi ni, 'Bangʼ ka usedonjo e piny mamiyouni kaka kar dak",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kendo uchiwone Jehova Nyasaye misengini miwangʼo pep koa kuom kweth mag dhok kata mag jamni, kaka gima dungʼ tik mangʼwe ngʼar mamoro Jehova Nyasaye bed ni gin misengini miwangʼo pep, chiwo mar hera, chiwo mag kwongʼruok kata mago mag nyasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangʼe ngʼama kelo chiwo mare nokelne Jehova Nyasaye chiwo mar cham maromo achiel kuom apar mar efa mar mogo mayom moruw gi achiel kuom angʼwen mar lita mar mo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bende nyaka uchiw achiel kuom angʼwen mar lita mar divai mondo obed misango miolo piny kuom nyarombo ka nyarombo mutimogo misango miwangʼo pep kata misango mar nyasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Ka chiayo mitimogo misangono en im, to mogo mitimogo misango mar cham nyaka bed kilo angʼwen gi nus moruw gi mo moromo lita achiel gi nus,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kendo uchiw lita achiel gi nus mar divai kaka misango miolo piny. Kamano e kaka unuchiwne Jehova Nyasaye misango madungʼ tik mangʼwe ngʼar ne Jehova Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'To ka en nyarwath ema utimogo ne Jehova Nyasaye misango miwangʼo pep, kata misango mar sawo, kaka singruok mowal kata chiwo mar lalruok ne Jehova Nyasaye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to ukel rwath kaachiel gi chiwo mar cham maromo kilo ariyo mar mogo mayom moru gi nus mar lita mar mo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bende ukel nus mar lita mar divai kaka misango miolo piny. Obiro bedo chiwo mowangʼ miwangʼo, ma en gima dungʼ tik mangʼwe ngʼar mamoro Jehova Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwath ka rwath, im ka im, rombo ka rombo, kata nyadiel ka nyadiel, nyaka losi e yo machal kamano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timuru ma ne misengini duto mag jamni moro ka moro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Ngʼato angʼata monywol e pinyni ma ja-Israel nyaka tim gigi, ka okelo chiwo molos gi mach kaka gima dungʼ tik mangʼwe ngʼar mamoro Jehova Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ne tiengʼ mabiro, kinde duto ma japiny moro kata ngʼato angʼata modak e kindu okelo misango molos gi mach kaka gima dungʼ tik mangʼwe ngʼar mamoro Jehova Nyasaye, nyaka otim mana kaka utimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oganda jo-Israel nyaka bed gi chike machalre ne tiengʼ mabiro kod jopinje mamoko; ma en singo mochwere ne tiengʼ mabiro. Un kod jopinje mamoko nubed machalre e nyim Jehova Nyasaye:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chik achiel ema omakou machalre gi jopinje mamoko modak e dieru.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ne Musa niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Wuo gi jo-Israel kendo iwachnegi kama: 'Ka udonjo e piny ma ateroue,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kendo uchamo chiemb pinyno, to uchiw bathe moko kaka misango ne Jehova Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiw cham moa e nyak mokwongo mar lopi kendo ichiwe kaka misango moa e laru mar dino cham.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E tienge duto mabiro nyaka ugol misangoni ne Jehova Nyasaye koa e nyak mokwongo mar lopi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Misengini mag richo ma ngʼato otimo kokia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Ka e kia maru ok urito chike mane Jehova Nyasaye omiyo Musa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma gin chike mane omiyou kokalo kuome, chakre e kinde mane Jehova Nyasaye ochiwogie kendo ka gidhi nyime nyaka e tienge mabiro;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to ka ma otim maonge chenro ka oganda ok ongʼeyo, to oganda duto nochiw nyarwath matin kaka misango miwangʼo pep ma en gima dungʼ tik mangʼwe ngʼar mamoro Jehova Nyasaye, kaachiel gi chiwo mar cham kod misango miolo piny, kod nywok kaka misango mar golo richo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jadolo notim pwodhoruok ne oganda duto mag jo-Israel, kendo nowenegi richogi, nimar ne ok gingʼeyo gima negitimo kendo gisekelone Jehova Nyasaye misango mowangʼ pep kuom ketho margi kod misango mar golo richo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oganda duto mag jo-Israel kod jopinje mamoko manie dieru nowenegi richogi, nikech ji duto notimo richo ka ok gingʼeyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'To ka ngʼato achiel ema otimo richo ka ok ongʼeyo, to nyaka ochiw diel madhako ma ja-higa achiel kaka misango mar golo richo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jadolo notim pwodhruok e nyim Jehova Nyasaye ne ngʼatno motimo richo ka ok ongʼeyo, kendo ka osetimne pwodhruok, nowene richo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chik achielno ema oket ne ngʼato angʼata motimo richo ka ok ongʼeyo, bed ni en jakanyo ma ja-Israel kata japiny moro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'To ka ngʼato otimo richo gi wangʼ matek, bed ni en japinyno kata japiny moro, to ojaro Jehova Nyasaye, kendo ngʼat makamano onego ogol oko e dier jogi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikech osejaro wach Jehova Nyasaye kendo oketho chikene, ngʼatno nyaka gol oko; kendo richo mare nodongʼ e wiye.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngʼama oketho Sabato inego",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane jo-Israel ne nitie e thim, ngʼat moro noyud ka modo yien chiengʼ Sabato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joma ne oyude ka omodo yien nokele ir Musa gi Harun kod chokruok duto,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kendo ne gikane e od twech, nikech ne ok ongʼere malongʼo gima onego timne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ne Musa niya, \"Ngʼatno nyaka negi. Chokruok duto nyaka chiele gi kite e oko mar kambi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omiyo ogandago nogole oko mar kambi kendo negichiele gi kite motho, mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye nochiko Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Usi motwangʼ e riak law",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ne Musa niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Wuo gi jo-Israel kendo iwachnegi kama: 'Ne tiengʼ duto mabiro nyaka umin usi e riak lepu ka usi moro ka moro olwor gi kido marambulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usi momin molier e riak lepugo nomi unupar chike duto mag Jehova Nyasaye, mondo omi uritgi ma ok uteroru gi gombo mag chunjeu kod wengeu uwegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangʼ mano unupar mar rito chikena duto kendo nowalu tenge ne Nyasachu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An e Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu, mane ogolou Misri mondo obed Nyasachu. An Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
